---
// SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
// Copyright 2026 C65 LLC
//
// "A C65 LLC project": the C65 mark and a link to https://c65llc.com, in the
// landing page's footer (src/pages/index.astro) and in every Starlight
// page's footer (src/components/Footer.astro).
//
// The mark is C65's own, copied exactly from c65llc.com's source
// (c65llc_site: src/components/Logo.astro and public/favicon.svg): the same
// viewBox and paths, the "C" in currentColor and the "65" in ember
// (#b8653d, c65llc.com's --color-rust). It is inlined, never loaded from
// c65llc.com. Ember is at least 3:1 (WCAG 1.4.11) on every footer ground the
// site has: 4.34:1 on the landing footer (#0a1524), 3.97:1 on the docs' dark
// ground (#101e30) and 4.23:1 on their light one (#ffffff);
// e2e/footer.spec.ts checks it.
//
// The link's colour is inherited: each footer sets it. No inline style, so
// the CSP (scripts/csp-postbuild.mjs) has nothing to hash.
---

<a class="c65-credit" href="https://c65llc.com" rel="noopener">
  <svg class="c65-mark" viewBox="89.8 156 280.4 148.4" width="38" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M216 156H164A74.2 74.2 0 0 0 164 304.4H192.5A64.4 64.4 0 0 1 172 278.8H164A48.6 48.6 0 0 1 164 181.6H199.5Z"></path>
    <path
      class="c65-ember"
      d="M231.6 157.2H262.5L208.5 238.3A25.8 25.8 0 1 0 233 226.9L247.7 203.7A51.6 51.6 0 1 1 187.2 224ZM278.4 158.4H369.2V183.7H261.2ZM283.2 215.3A51.5 51.5 0 1 1 283.2 289.5A64.8 64.8 0 0 0 293.9 266A28.4 28.4 0 1 0 293.9 239A64.8 64.8 0 0 0 283.2 215.3Z"
    ></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="c65-credit-text">A C65 LLC project</span>
</a>

<style>
  .c65-credit {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .c65-mark {
    flex: none;
    width: 38px;
    height: 20px;
  }
  .c65-ember {
    fill: #b8653d;
  }
  .c65-credit:hover .c65-credit-text {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
